\label{lem4}
    	There exists a constant $C $ depending on $\Omega$, $T$, $\mu$, $\beta$, $\gamma$, $\|b(x)\|_{L^{\infty}}$, $\|\rho_0\|_{L^{\infty}}$, and $\|u_0\|_{H^1}$ such that
